# Locked — Marketing landing, SyncIQ & Developer API UI

**Default: do not read for edits, do not modify, do not revert, do not deploy changes to these areas** unless the user explicitly says they want to work on the landing page, marketing site, SyncIQ, reseller flows, developer API docs/dashboard, or Stripe extension checkout.

**Source of truth for developer API UI:** `../MCP/auralink-ai/frontend/app/developers/` (not the old inline dark docs in git history). When restoring developers pages, sync from MCP — do not resurrect `page.tsx` with "Build with Synclyst API".

## Locked files & routes

### Landing / marketing
- `auralink-ai/frontend/public/landing.html`
- `auralink-ai/frontend/public/landing-old.html`
- `auralink-ai/frontend/scripts/sync-root-index-from-landing.js`
- Root `/` rewrite in `middleware.ts` (only change if user asks about landing routing)
- Stripe checkout links and pricing copy on the landing page

### SyncIQ (reseller / scan product)
- `auralink-ai/frontend/public/home.html` (serves `/scan`)
- `auralink-ai/frontend/public/snap.html` (`/snap`)
- `auralink-ai/frontend/public/reseller-*.html`
- `auralink-ai/frontend/public/js/synclyst-home-reseller-intel.js`
- `auralink-ai/frontend/public/js/synclyst-quota-modal.js`
- `auralink-ai/frontend/pages/api/v1/vision/reseller-scan.js`
- `/scan`, `/snap`, `/reseller-*` rewrites in `next.config.mjs`

## Forbidden during Shopify / app work

- `git checkout` or `git restore` on any locked file above
- "Restore locked version" of `landing.html`
- Adding `landing.html` back to `scripts/inject-api-url.js` targets
- Replacing Stripe landing checkout with `/billing` (Shopify billing is only for the Shopify app path)

### Developer API (docs + dashboard)
- `auralink-ai/frontend/app/developers/**`
- `auralink-ai/frontend/lib/developer-plans.ts`, `synclyst-clerk-appearance.ts`, `clerk-server-token.ts`
- `auralink-ai/frontend/app/api/developers/**`, `app/api/billing/api-checkout`, `api-usage-setup`

## Safe to change (Shopify / SyncLyst app)

- `flow-2.html`, `flow-3.html`, `stores-connect-shopify.html`, `/list`, `/review`, `/billing` (Shopify billing only)
- `auralink-ai/publishing/**`, Shopify App Router routes, `/shopify/launch`

## Deploy commands (use the narrowest one)

| Task | Command |
|------|---------|
| Publishing API only | `npm run deploy:shopify-api` |
| Frontend (full Vercel site) | `npm run deploy:frontend` |
| Both | `npm run deploy:shopify-all` |

`npm run preflight:deploy` blocks `vercel --prod` if locked files changed vs git.

## Override

Only when the user clearly requests landing, SyncIQ, developer API, reseller, or extension Stripe marketing work.
